OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA pleasant
OL,6,Fevening to come with clear skies and
OL,7,Fsunshine. Then remaining dry and fine
OL,8,Fovernight with lengthy clear skies. A
OL,9,Ffew mist and fog patches forming under
OL,10,Fthe clear skies, with temperatures
OL,11,Ffalling into single figures in rural
OL,12,Fareas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,15,Fsunny spells, especially in the west.
OL,16,FEastern areas may see cloud
OL,17,Foccasionally move in from the North
OL,18,FSea, with the odd spot of rain
OL,19,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
